    <detaileddescription>
<para>Class used to describe an monomial order and/or a module monomial order. Use this class to construct a monoid. The monoid does the actual comparisons. Monomials must be preprocessed by <ref refid="class_mono_processor" kindref="compound">MonoProcessor</ref> - otherwise the ordering may not be correct. <ref refid="class_mono_processor" kindref="compound">MonoProcessor</ref> also offers additional parameters for making orders. </para>
